    "chapter": "Character Creation",
    "section": "2.43",
    "heading": "Armor Class",
    "lineStart": 1307,
    "lineEnd": 1311
  },
  "section": "2.43",
  "rulesText": "If you have multiple ways to calculate your Armor Class, you can benefit from only one at a time. For example, a Monk/Sorcerer with a Monk's\n\nUnarmored Defense feature and a Sorcerer's Draconic Resilience feature must choose only one of those features as a way to calculate Armor Class."
}
